"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Two complete award itineraries offer an economy-versus-business choice.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J18@2027-01-08T11:47-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-10T08:50\",\"n\":\"Turkish award itinerary — economy\",\"v\":\"At 110,000 Turkish points, this is the lower-point economy option compared with the business itinerary. It arrives 4 hours 35 minutes later and takes 1 hour 43 minutes longer.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J77@2027-01-08T08:55-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-10T04:15\",\"n\":\"Turkish award itinerary — business\",\"v\":\"Consider this for the reported business cabin and a shorter trip: it arrives 4 hours 35 minutes earlier than the economy option. Its SFO–LAX transfer is 2 hours 14 minutes, versus 5 hours 1 minute for economy.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Both rely on separately booked SFO–LAX positioning, and whether that arrangement is permitted or protected is unresolved. Award seat support for one traveler is unconfirmed; award taxes and total price scope are unknown, as is the scope of the positioning-fare quotes.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-08T06:05-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash fare context\",\"v\":\"The search results quote USD 452.00 for SFO to BKK; the quote scope is unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"There is also a date-only Alaska award summary, not a timed itinerary; its award-tax quote scope is unknown.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A3@2027-01-08/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Alaska economy award summary\",\"v\":\"If Alaska miles are an option for you, this is a separate program to check for its reported 42,500-point economy award.\"}]}"
